OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over late post and
OL,4,Amissed appointments
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have described their
OL,7,Ffrustration at missing key medical
OL,8,Fappointments because of post arriving
OL,9,Flate.
OL,11,FThe BBC spoke to people across Reading
OL,12,Fabout their experiences, with one woman
OL,13,Fsaying she and her husband had missed
OL,14,Fmore than 10 medical appointments over
OL,15,Fthe past year.
OL,17,FThree Labour MPs have already written
OL,18,Fan open letter to Royal Mail after
OL,19,Fnumerous complaints from constituents
OL,20,Fabout delayed post and missed
OL,21,Fdeliveries.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
